        "rating": 6,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 14, 2025",
            "id": "29eecc7e-da10-48bc-a874-8e0732bad496",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your feedback and for taking the time to share your experience. We're glad to hear you enjoyed many aspects of the property. However, we sincerely apologize for the inconvenience caused by the A/C issue during your stay.\nWe understand how important a comfortable environment is, especially in the summer months, and we regret that the delay in service impacted your experience.\nPlease know that we have addressed the issue with our maintenance team to ensure the system is properly flushed and fully operational for future guests.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Everything about the property was wonderful except one major. Component- the A/C in the upstairs 3 bedroom location had been shutting off and temps got for 79 degrees. We were able to bypass the system shutting off but as a trade off we had to dump buckets of water 3 times a day to keep it from overflowing into the ceiling. The system needed to be flushed out so it could drain properly, someone came to. Check on it 6 days later, we were leaving the next day so don’t know if it got fixed.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Enjoyable at a cost",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
